# A module is entered by name (`shelltutor shells`, C-001), keeps its
# fixtures under $SANDBOX/<name>/ (C-003) and never touches .progress. It
# follows the stage pattern: intro, lessons, a recall gate, a task, a
# cleared screen. Headings are the harness sentinels and are binding:
